RECORD OF PROCEEDINGS FOR THE GOVERNING BODY
OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE
Office of City Clerk
 September 8, 2014
The Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne met in regular session on this date beginning
at 6:00 p.m. in Council Chambers.  Present were: MAYOR - Richard L. Kaysen; COUNCIL
MEMBERS - Mr. Allen, Mr. Brown, Ms. Broyles, Mr. Cook, Mr. Luna, Dr. Rinne, Mr. Shanor, Mr.
Valdez and Ms. Williams.  Also present:  Carol Intlekofer, City Clerk; Lois Huff, City Treasurer,
and Dan White, City Attorney.  The pledge of allegiance was recited.
Consent Agenda.  (All agenda items listed with the designation of [CA] are considered to be
routine items by the governing body and will be enacted by one motion. There will be no separate
discussion on these items unless a member of the governing body so requests and support by two
other members is received.  Any item removed from the Consent Agenda will be considered in its
normal sequence on the agenda.)  Mr. Shanor moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Luna.  Motion
carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body.
[CA]
Minutes from Regular Meeting of the Governing Body on August 25, 2014.  Motion (per
Consent Agenda) carried.
Mr. Brown and Mr. Shanor each declared a conflict of interest (business interest in vouchers
payable to Ameri-Tech HVAC Services and First Judicial District Attorney’s Office respectively)
and vacated Council Chambers.  Mr. Valdez moved to approve payment of vouchers as presented,
seconded by Ms. Williams.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body
present in Council Chambers.  Following announcement of the vote, Mr. Brown and Mr. Shanor
returned to Council Chambers.
ORDINANCE - Pursuant to Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendments, Section 5.1.2, Zoning
Districts Established, and Section 5.1.3, Official Zoning Map, of the Unified Development Code,
changing the zoning classification from County MR Medium Density Residential to MR-2 Medium
Density Residential - Developing for the West 178’ of the North 102’ of Tract 324, Tract A (West
120’ of the North 102’ of Tract 323 and all of the North 102’ of Tract 324 except the West 178’) and
Tract B (all of the North 102’ of Tract 323 except the West 120’), Sunnyside Addition, 7th Filing,
Cheyenne, Wyoming, to be known as Diamond Estates, 5th Filing (Replat in process) (located at the
southeast corner of the intersection of Rock Springs Street and Pierce Avenue).  Reporting for Public
Services Committee, Mr. Shanor moved to approve on third and final reading, seconded by Ms.
Williams.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the  governing body. (#4040)

ORDINANCE - Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, portions of tracts 245, 246,
247 and 248, Sunnyside Addition, 6th Filing, Laramie County, Wyoming (located at the northwest
corner of the intersection of Hayes Avenue and US Highway 30).  Mr. Shanor moved to approve on
third and final reading, seconded by Ms. Williams.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members
of the governing body. (#4041)
```

